# Hits: lines 8 and 9 (7+ digit decimal literal without a separator).
# Non-hits: 14 (6 digits), 15 (already separated), 16 (hex), 17 (short).
# Known FP shapes: IDs, timestamps and error codes that read fine as one run;
# the rule is hint-level and exists only for the modernize category.
unreadable-literal 9
unreadable-literal 10
!unreadable-literal 15
!unreadable-literal 16
!unreadable-literal 17
!unreadable-literal 18
